# Fully-local setup — no secrets required.
#
# All model config now lives in compose.podman.yml (routed through the local
# `ollama` container), so this file is no longer read by the podman stack.
# Nothing to put here. Kept only so the dir matches .env.example.
#
# If you ever switch to cloud models, add the key here and re-add
# `env_file: [.env]` to the services in compose.podman.yml.
